     "message": {
      "text": "The Qwen3.5-0.8B-IQ4_XS.gguf entry still declares no `budget` key; the diff changes only the comment, why_unmeasured and owed_by. thinking_on_budget_row returns Err for a matched row without a u64 budget, so the ON leg refuses rather than inheriting the default."
     },
     "properties": {
      "grounding": "cited",
      "failure_scenario": "Had the diff added a budget or a waiver key the row would pass or skip; it adds neither, so the refusal at this line still fires.",
      "precision_class": "advisory",
      "source": "crates/apr-cli/src/commands/golden_output.rs:363",
      "excerpt": "    let Some(b) = v.get(\"budget\").and_then(serde_yaml::Value::as_u64) else {",
